---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Runs real native UI/system-dialog scenarios through an OS driver

Usage: leptoskit test native [OPTIONS] --suite <SUITE>

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --suite <SUITE>      JSON scenario containing the session and ordered actions/assertions
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
